<td id="S5.T2.6.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S5.T2.6.11.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;">   <math id="S5.T2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{Duo}^{++}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mtext style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;" mathbackground="#EBEBEB">Duo</mtext><mrow><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;" mathbackground="#EBEBEB">+</mo><mo lspace="0em">⁣</mo><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;" mathbackground="#EBEBEB">+</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{Duo}^{++}</annotation></semantics></math> (Ours), <math id="S5.T2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;" mathbackground="#EBEBEB">k</mi><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;" mathbackground="#EBEBEB">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;" mathbackground="#EBEBEB">2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=2</annotation></semantics></math></span></td>
