variant="normal">ℓ</mi></msubsup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;" mathcolor="#808080">o</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">({\mathbf{w}}_{t}^{{\color[rgb]{0.4688,0.4688,0.4688}\ell}})_{o}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
