<figure id="A4.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>FID on CIFAR-10 with ancestral sampling. We train and sample with the log-linear and cosine scheduler. MDLM performs best with time-conditioning while Duo does not. We sample with discrete classifier-free guidance <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">Schiff et al., 2025</a>)</cite> with strength <math id="A4.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1</annotation></semantics></math>, and greedy predictions on the last step.</figcaption>
